From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yzddmr6 <46088090+yzddmr6@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 07:04:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media: qcom: camss: use qcom,sm8475-camss for the liuqin rear
 path

The CAMSS binding added for the liuqin rear camera only describes a
subset of the block (CSIPHY0-3, CSID0 and IFE0), and it was only
validated on SM8475.  Claiming the generic "qcom,sm8450-camss"
compatible for it would collide with a full SM8450 CAMSS binding, which
has to describe every capture engine.

Name the subset after the SoC it was validated on instead:

 - rename the binding to qcom,sm8475-camss.yaml and update its $id,
   title, compatible and example;
 - describe it as the rear capture path subset of the SM8475 CAMSS
   rather than as a downstream, board-specific binding;
 - match "qcom,sm8475-camss" in the driver and use it in the liuqin DTS.

The driver's internal CAMSS_8450 version and sm8450_resources tables
are unchanged; only the device tree ABI string moves.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0119npaRT3BS6ioVvnE1XeMT
Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/qcom,sm8450-camss.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/qcom,sm8475-camss.yaml
similarity index 93%
rename from Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/qcom,sm8450-camss.yaml
rename to Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/qcom,sm8475-camss.yaml
index d82d15e90..94e74920b 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/qcom,sm8450-camss.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/qcom,sm8475-camss.yaml
@@ -1,23 +1,23 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0-only OR BSD-2-Clause)
 %YAML 1.2
 ---
-$id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/media/qcom,sm8450-camss.yaml#
+$id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/media/qcom,sm8475-camss.yaml#
 $schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
 
-title: Qualcomm SM8450 Camera Subsystem (CAMSS)
+title: Qualcomm SM8475 Camera Subsystem (CAMSS)
 
 maintainers:
   - reisa <reisa8366@gmail.com>
 
 description:
-  The camera subsystem receives CSI data and writes image buffers to memory.
-  This downstream binding describes the resource subset implemented for the
-  SM8475 liuqin rear camera, using CSIPHY0-3, CSID0 and IFE0. It does not
-  describe the remaining capture engines present in the hardware.
+  The SM8475 camera subsystem receives CSI data and writes image buffers to
+  memory. This binding describes the rear capture path subset of the SM8475
+  CAMSS, made of CSIPHY0-3, CSID0 and IFE0. The other capture engines present
+  in the hardware are not described.
 
 properties:
   compatible:
-    const: qcom,sm8450-camss
+    const: qcom,sm8475-camss
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 7
@@ -156,7 +156,7 @@ examples:
         #size-cells = <2>;
 
         isp@ac62000 {
-            compatible = "qcom,sm8450-camss";
+            compatible = "qcom,sm8475-camss";
 
             reg = <0x0 0x0ac62000 0x0 0xf000>,
                   <0x0 0x0acb7000 0x0 0x0d00>,
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8475-xiaomi-liuqin.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8475-xiaomi-liuqin.dts
index 33f1c8edd..3be362d74 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8475-xiaomi-liuqin.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8475-xiaomi-liuqin.dts
@@ -1787,7 +1787,7 @@
  */
 &soc {
 	camss: isp@ac62000 {
-		compatible = "qcom,sm8450-camss";
+		compatible = "qcom,sm8475-camss";
 
 		reg = <0x0 0x0ac62000 0x0 0xf000>,
 		      <0x0 0x0acb7000 0x0 0x0d00>,
diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c
index c84a7ac8d..4d5503876 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c
@@ -4004,7 +4004,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id camss_dt_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sdm670-camss", .data = &sdm670_resources },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sdm845-camss", .data = &sdm845_resources },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8250-camss", .data = &sm8250_resources },
-	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8450-camss", .data = &sm8450_resources },
+	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8475-camss", .data = &sm8450_resources },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8550-camss", .data = &sm8550_resources },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,x1e80100-camss", .data = &x1e80100_resources },
 	{ }
